# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Shri Gajanan Seva — environment variables
#
# Copy to `.env.local` for local development. On Vercel, set these under
# Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
#
# EVERY variable here is optional. With none of them set the site builds and
# runs completely; the forms fall back to pre-filled mailto: links rather than
# pretending to have sent something. Nothing is silently broken.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------


# --- Pre-launch password gate ----------------------------------------------
# REQUIRED IN PRODUCTION until launch.
#
# HTTP Basic auth over every route, asset and API handler. Without
# SITE_PASSWORD a production deploy refuses to serve at all (503) rather than
# going public by accident. Local `npm run dev` is unaffected.
#
# ASCII only — a non-ASCII character in the password will break the auth
# header and lock everybody out.

SITE_PASSWORD=change-me-before-deploying
# SITE_USER=seva          # optional, defaults to "seva"

# At launch: clear SITE_PASSWORD and set this to open the site to the public.
# SITE_PUBLIC=true


# --- Form delivery ---------------------------------------------------------
# Used by the contact form, the newsletter signup and the privacy rights
# request queue. Set ONE of the two. FORM_WEBHOOK_URL takes precedence.

# Option A — POST each submission as JSON to a webhook.
# Works with Zapier, Make, n8n, or a Google Apps Script bound to a Sheet,
# which is likely the lowest-friction option for the trustees.
# FORM_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/catch/000000/abcdef

# Option B — send each submission as an email via Resend.
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# RESEND_FROM=website@shrigajananseva.org


# --- Payments --------------------------------------------------------------
# Not yet in use. /donate/online is an honest interim page and reads none of
# these. When a processor is chosen, wire it there — the donation builder
# already passes fund, amount, frequency and coverFees as query parameters.
#
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_xxxxxxxx
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_xxxxxxxx
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_xxxxxxxx


# --- Database --------------------------------------------------------------
# Not yet in use. The devotee portal runs against an in-memory demo adapter.
# When a database is provisioned, implement PortalRepository against it and
# swap the single export in lib/portal/session.ts.
#
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:password@host:5432/shrigajananseva


# --- Analytics -------------------------------------------------------------
# Vercel Analytics and Speed Insights need no keys — enable them in the Vercel
# dashboard. They are cookieless, which is why this site needs no cookie
# consent banner. Do not add Google Analytics without also adding a banner and
# updating the privacy policy.
